---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = 'Terms of Service | Admoran';
const description = 'Terms covering work engaged through admoran.com.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-section px-6 py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-prose">
      <h1 class="font-heading text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem)] font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">
        Terms.
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-muted">Last updated: August 2026.</p>

      <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-[1.0625rem] leading-relaxed text-muted">
        <p>
          Admoran is the trading name of Vincent Mbogo. These terms cover work engaged through
          admoran.com — SEO audits, local SEO / GBP work, monthly retainers, and web design builds.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Engagement</h2>
        <p>
          Scope, price, and timeline for any project are agreed directly, in writing, before work
          starts — the prices on this site are the standard starting point, not a binding quote
          until confirmed for your specific project.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-ink">No ranking guarantees</h2>
        <p>
          I don't guarantee specific search rankings — no one legitimately can, and Google's own
          terms of service prohibit that claim. What I commit to is the work itself: the audit,
          the fixes, the build, done properly and reported on honestly.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Retainers</h2>
        <p>
          Monthly retainers carry a six-month minimum, then roll month-to-month with 30 days'
          notice either way, as described on the pricing pages for each service.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about these terms — reach me on
          <a href="https://wa.me/254743747496" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-semibold text-ink underline decoration-accent/40 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-accent">WhatsApp</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
